<title>UK: European precious metals end narrowly mixed.</title>
<headline>European precious metals end narrowly mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $339.70/$340.20, down 10 cents having touched 11-week low AM. Very bearish despite some physical interest.</p>
<p>U.S. economic data significant for direction.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ended up a cent at $4.66/$4.68. Fixed at 25-month low but found some support after fund selling. Technically weak.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Closed quietly down $0.50 at $372.50/$373.50.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Finished up $0.50 at $157.25/$158.25.</p>
</text>
